---
import { getImage } from "astro:assets";
import titleCh4Url from "../../assets/chapter4/title_ch4.svg?url";
import tapeBelgiumUrl from "../../assets/chapter4/titleCh04_01.png?url";
import brusselsDesktopSrc from "../../assets/chapter4/brussels_desktop.png";
import brusselsMobileSrc from "../../assets/chapter4/brussels_mobile.png";
import paper02Src from "../../assets/chapter1/paper_02.png";
import tapeArtisticUrl from "../../assets/chapter4/titleCh04_02.png?url";
import oneDaySrc from "../../assets/chapter4/one_day.png";
import humbleSrc from "../../assets/chapter4/humble.png";
import tapeComingBackUrl from "../../assets/chapter4/titleCh04_03.png?url";

const brusselsDesktop = await getImage({
    src: brusselsDesktopSrc,
    format: "webp",
});
const brusselsMobile = await getImage({
    src: brusselsMobileSrc,
    format: "webp",
});
const paper02 = await getImage({ src: paper02Src, format: "webp" });
const oneDay = await getImage({ src: oneDaySrc, format: "webp" });
const humble = await getImage({ src: humbleSrc, format: "webp" });
---

<div class="chapter4">
    <div class="chapter4__header">
        <p class="chapter4__eyebrow">Chapter 4</p>

        <div class="chapter4__title-wrap">
            <img
                src={titleCh4Url}
                alt="This is the title of Chapter 4, which reads 'Full circle'"
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="chapter4__title-img"
            />
            <h2 class="visually-hidden">Full circle</h2>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chapter4__hero">
        <section class="chapter4__block chapter4__block--belgium">
            <div class="chapter4__label-wrap">
                <img
                    src={tapeBelgiumUrl}
                    alt="This image represents the subtitle of Chapter 4, which reads 'Back to Belgium'"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="chapter4__label-img"
                />
                <h3 class="visually-hidden">Back to Belgium</h3>
            </div>

            <div
                class="chapter4__note"
                style={`--note-bg: url(${paper02.src})`}
            >
                <p>
                    Once she decided to step back, Marina returned to Belgium
                    and went back to what she knew best: creating.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Without trying to fit herself into one way of working, she
                    began moving freely between different mediums again,
                    following whatever sparked her curiosity and seeing where it
                    would take her. In many ways, it echoed the world she had
                    built for herself as a child — one where making could begin
                    and end anywhere.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div
            class="chapter4__cityscape"
            style={`--cityscape-bg-mobile: url(${brusselsMobile.src}); --cityscape-bg-desktop: url(${brusselsDesktop.src})`}
        >
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="chapter4__block chapter4__block--artistic">
        <div class="chapter4__artistic-text">
            <div class="chapter4__label-wrap">
                <img
                    src={tapeArtisticUrl}
                    alt=""
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="chapter4__label-img chapter4__label-img--artistic"
                />
                <h3 class="visually-hidden">Artistic freedom</h3>
            </div>

            <p class="chapter4__paragraph">
                Her creativity spread in every direction. She designed costumes
                for theatre, worked on womenswear for Dirk Bikkembergs, taught
                drawing and fashion, painted, made collages and objects,
                experimented with interiors, and continued making clothes from
                second-hand materials in her apartments' studio. One medium
                seemed to open the door to another.
            </p>

            <p class="chapter4__paragraph">
                The more room she gave herself to experiment, the more she was
                feeling like herself again. During the years when she was less
                visible in the fashion industry, Marina continued drawing,
                designing, cutting, pasting and building an enormous body of
                work in the privacy of her studio. She kept going.
            </p>
        </div>

        <img
            src={oneDay.src}
            alt=""
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="chapter4__one-day-img"
        />

        <a
            href="https://www.momu.be/en"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="chapter4__link"
        >
            Discover her reconstructed studio at MoMu
        </a>
    </section>

    <section class="chapter4__block chapter4__block--comingback">
        <img
            src={humble.src}
            alt="Be humble. Trust. Love what you do."
            class="chapter4__humble-img"
        />

        <div class="chapter4__comingback-text">
            <div class="chapter4__label-wrap">
                <img
                    src={tapeComingBackUrl}
                    alt="This image represents the subtitle of Chapter 4, which reads 'Coming back to the industry on her own terms'"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="chapter4__label-img chapter4__label-img--comingback"
                />
                <h3 class="visually-hidden">
                    Coming back to the industry on her own terms
                </h3>
            </div>

            <p class="chapter4__paragraph">
                Years later, when she decided to step back in the spotlight of
                the fashion industry, the conditions were different. In 2018,
                she began working with LAILA TOKIO on the M.Y. Project in Japan.
                The scale was small, the team was limited, and there was no
                pressure to reproduce her ideas industrially. For the first time
                in a long while, the fashion world had changed so that it had
                enough room for Marina the fashion designer and for Marina the
                artist.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    .chapter4 {
        position: relative;
        padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .chapter4__eyebrow {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        font-family: var(--font-family-serif);
        font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
        color: var(--color-text-main);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* Belgium section */
    .chapter4__title-img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 23rem;
        height: auto;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .chapter4__hero {
        position: relative;
    }

    .chapter4__block--belgium {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .chapter4__label-img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 15rem;
        height: auto;
    }

    .chapter4__note {
        max-width: 17rem;
        background-image: none;
        padding: 1rem 0 3rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .chapter4__note p {
        font-size: var(--step-0);
        color: var(--color-text-main);
        text-align: justify;
    }

    .chapter4__cityscape {
        width: 100vw;
        margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
        margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);
        position: relative;
        aspect-ratio: 393 / 353;
        background-image: var(--cityscape-bg-mobile);
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: bottom center;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        margin-top: -13rem;
    }

    /* Artistic freedom */
    .chapter4__block--artistic {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 3rem; /* spacing after the Belgium section — tune */
    }

    .chapter4__artistic-text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .chapter4__label-img--artistic {
        max-width: 15rem;
    }

    .chapter4__paragraph {
        font-size: var(--step-0);
        color: var(--color-text-main);
        text-align: justify;
    }

    .chapter4__one-day-img {
        display: block;
        width: calc(100% + 1.5rem);
        max-width: none;
        height: auto;
        margin-left: 0;
        margin-right: -1.5rem;
    }

    .chapter4__link {
        text-decoration: underline;
        font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        font-size: var(--step-2);
    }

    /* Coming back to the industry on her own terms */
    .chapter4__block--comingback {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        grid-template-areas:
            "text"
            "image";
        row-gap: 1.5rem;
        padding-top: 5rem;
    }

    .chapter4__humble-img {
        grid-area: image;
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 24rem;
        height: auto;
        margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .chapter4__comingback-text {
        grid-area: text;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .chapter4__label-img--comingback {
        max-width: 20rem;
    }

    @media (min-width: 48rem) {
        .chapter4 {
            padding: 2rem 6rem;
        }

        .chapter4__title-img {
            max-width: 57rem;
        }

        /* Belgium section */
        .chapter4__block--belgium {
            position: absolute;
            top: 18rem;
            left: 12rem;
            max-width: 34rem;
        }

        .chapter4__label-img {
            max-width: 23rem;
            margin-bottom: -3rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
        }

        .chapter4__note {
            max-width: none;
            background-image: var(--note-bg);
            background-size: 100% 100%;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            padding: 4rem 3rem 5rem;
        }

        .chapter4__note p {
            max-width: 28rem;
        }

        .chapter4__cityscape {
            width: calc(100% + 12rem);
            margin-left: -6rem;
            margin-right: -6rem;
            aspect-ratio: 1440 / 809;
            background-image: var(--cityscape-bg-desktop);
            margin-top: -10rem;
        }

        /* Artistic freedom */
        .chapter4__block--artistic {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            grid-template-areas:
                "text image"
                "link image";
            column-gap: 3rem;
            row-gap: 1.5rem;
            align-items: start;
            margin-top: 8rem;
        }

        .chapter4__artistic-text {
            grid-area: text;
        }

        .chapter4__one-day-img {
            grid-area: image;
            width: calc(100% + 6rem);
            margin-right: -6rem;
        }

        .chapter4__link {
            grid-area: link;
            max-width: 32rem;
            margin-top: -4rem;
        }

        .chapter4__artistic-text {
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .chapter4__label-img--artistic {
            max-width: 23rem;
            padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .chapter4__block--artistic .chapter4__paragraph {
            max-width: 32rem;
        }

        /* Coming back to the industry on her own terms — humble.png on
           the left, heading+paragraph on the right. Same mirrored
           image-left/text-right pattern as Ch3's "She became his muse"
           section, but without a paragraph split since there's only one
           paragraph here (no mobile interruption to account for). */
        .chapter4__block--comingback {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            grid-template-areas: "image text";
            column-gap: 3rem;
            align-items: start;
            margin-top: 4rem; /* tune */
        }

        .chapter4__humble-img {
            grid-area: image;
            width: auto;
            max-width: 44rem;
            margin-top: -11rem;
            margin-left: -2rem;
        }

        .chapter4__comingback-text .chapter4__paragraph {
            max-width: 32rem;
        }

        .chapter4__comingback-text {
            grid-area: text;
        }

        .chapter4__label-img--comingback {
            max-width: 31rem;
            padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
    }
</style>
